---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="on-paper border-t border-paper-ink/10 bg-paper text-paper-ink" aria-labelledby="dove-t">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-12 py-24 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
    <div>
      <p class="t-kicker text-lime-deep">Dove trovarmi</p>
      <h2 id="dove-t" class="t-h2 mt-4">Online in tutta Italia. <span class="em">Di persona a Bergamo.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:pt-10">
      <p class="t-lead text-paper-ink/85">Lavoro online con attività di tutta Italia. Se sei a Bergamo o in provincia, possiamo vederci di persona da Caterinho, a Bergamo, per un caffè e per guardare il sito insieme. Su appuntamento.</p>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid overflow-hidden rounded-[1.4rem] border border-paper-ink/15 sm:grid-cols-2 [&>div+div]:border-t [&>div+div]:border-paper-ink/15 sm:[&>div+div]:border-l sm:[&>div+div]:border-t-0">
        <div class="bg-paper p-6">
          <dt class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-medium"><Icon name="globe" class="size-5 text-lime-deep" />Online</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-paper-muted">In tutta Italia, in videochiamata.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-paper p-6">
          <dt class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display font-medium"><Icon name="map-pin" class="size-5 text-lime-deep" />Di persona</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-paper-muted">Da Caterinho, a Bergamo, su appuntamento.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
